{"id":"7fdc7a7a93d79109","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-finite-envelope-iteration.md","title":"df finite envelope iteration","display":"df finite envelope iteration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-finite-envelope-iteration","aliases":["72-df-finite-envelope-iteration"],"display":"df finite envelope iteration","depends_on":["[[72-df-program-envelope]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX Definition3.3.1 and §4.2 before Theorem4.2.4, print653,658/PDF665,670; fixed-base formulation","verification_status":"source-definition-checked; fixed-base specialization checked","proof_status":"definition-well-defined; monotonicity proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-finite-envelope-iteration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-finite-envelope-iteration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df finite envelope iteration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c4d010edfaaea6b\" href=\"?note=6c4d010edfaaea6b\" title=\"72-df-program-envelope\">72-df-program-envelope</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX Definition3.3.1 and §4.2 before Theorem4.2.4, print653,658/PDF665,670; fixed-base formulation"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked; fixed-base specialization checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined; monotonicity proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c4d010edfaaea6b\" href=\"?note=6c4d010edfaaea6b\" title=\"72-df-program-envelope\">72-df-program-envelope</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 与基底 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,(c^M),(f^M)\">\\(D,(c^M),(f^M)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\">\\(M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是该基底的全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf u\">\\(\\mathsf u\\)</span> 结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_P\">\\(\\mathcal E_P\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_P\">\\(I_P\\)</span> 使用同一基底。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_P^{[n]}\">\\(M_P^{[n]}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_P^n\">\\(J_P^n\\)</span> 由下式递归引入，不预设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(M)\">\\(M\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(M)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nM_P^{[0]}&amp;:=M,\\qquad M_P^{[n+1]}:=\\mathcal E_P(M_P^{[n]}),\\\\\nJ_P^n&amp;:=U_P^{[n]},\\\\\nM\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(M)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall n\\le m&lt;\\omega\\ (M_P^{[n]}\\sqsubseteq M_P^{[m]}),\\\\\n\\forall n\\le m&lt;\\omega&amp;\\ (J_P^n\\sqsubseteq J_P^m\\sqsubseteq I_P).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nM_P^{[0]}&amp;:=M,\\qquad M_P^{[n+1]}:=\\mathcal E_P(M_P^{[n]}),\\\\\nJ_P^n&amp;:=U_P^{[n]},\\\\\nM\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(M)&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall n\\le m&lt;\\omega\\ (M_P^{[n]}\\sqsubseteq M_P^{[m]}),\\\\\n\\forall n\\le m&lt;\\omega&amp;\\ (J_P^n\\sqsubseteq J_P^m\\sqsubseteq I_P).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>IX Definition 3.3.1 的有限阶段和 §4.2 的任意初始结构迭代分别对应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_P^n\">\\(J_P^n\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_P^{[n]}\">\\(M_P^{[n]}\\)</span>。自然数递归给存在唯一性；若首步递增，envelope 单调性逐步给相邻阶段递增。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为底，所以首步自动递增；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\sqsubseteq I_P=\\mathcal E_P(I_P)\">\\(U\\sqsubseteq I_P=\\mathcal E_P(I_P)\\)</span> 再归纳给上界。任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的迭代不能无条件宣称递增；有限阶段也不能无条件宣称充分或已经达到不动点。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-program-envelope","status":"resolved","id":"6c4d010edfaaea6b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-program-envelope]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-program-envelope","status":"resolved","id":"6c4d010edfaaea6b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 [[72-df-program-envelope]] 的 $P$ 与基底 $D,(c^M),(f^M)$，$M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)$，$U$ 是该基底的全 $\\mathsf u$ 结构。$\\mathcal E_P$ 与 $I_P$ 使用同一基底。$n,m\\in\\omega$；$M_P^{[n]}$ 和 $J_P^n$ 由下式递归引入，不预设 $M\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(M)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"D,(c^M),(f^M)","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in K_\\Sigma(D)","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf u","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_P","display":false},{"tex":"I_P","display":false},{"tex":"n,m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"M_P^{[n]}","display":false},{"tex":"J_P^n","display":false},{"tex":"M\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nM_P^{[0]}&:=M,\\qquad M_P^{[n+1]}:=\\mathcal E_P(M_P^{[n]}),\\\\\nJ_P^n&:=U_P^{[n]},\\\\\nM\\sqsubseteq\\mathcal E_P(M)&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\forall n\\le m<\\omega\\ (M_P^{[n]}\\sqsubseteq M_P^{[m]}),\\\\\n\\forall n\\le m<\\omega&\\ (J_P^n\\sqsubseteq J_P^m\\sqsubseteq I_P).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"J_P^n","display":false},{"tex":"M_P^{[n]}","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"U\\sqsubseteq I_P=\\mathcal E_P(I_P)","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1701,"backlinks":[{"id":"59d9dc7ce0d1cae1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P,\\Sigma,U,J_P^n$ 取 [[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]]，$A,B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma$，$n\\in\\omega$，$s\\in D^V$。$R\\in\\Sigma_{\\rm rel}$，$\\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)^{a_R(R)}$，$x\\in V$。$D_R^P(\\vec t)$ 直接取 [[72-df-program-definition-form]] 中固定枚举和最小新鲜变量算法给出的确定公式，不另选择任意的 $\\alpha$ 代表。"},{"id":"585b074277aea3ae","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\theta$ 为序数；$J^\\theta_{K,\\sqsubseteq,U,\\mathcal E_P}$ 取 [[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]。$J_P^n$ 是 [[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]] 的有限阶段，$n\\in\\omega$。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-411","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-finite-envelope-iteration|df finite envelope iteration]]"},{"id":"92e9c5c40b78fb74","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\vdash_r^{-n}\\Gamma$ 采用 [[72-df-identity-free-program-calculus]] 的有限集合推导；$M_P^{[n]}$ 采用 [[72-df-finite-envelope-iteration]]。$M$ 是固定基底 $D$ 上的四值结构，$\\operatorname{Lower}(M)$ 采用 [[72-thm-least-adequate-lower-structure]]，$\\operatorname{EqBase}_\\Sigma(M)$ 采用 calculus 的 CET 上游。$V=\\mathrm{Var}_S$，$s$ 遍历 $D^V$。"}],"outgoing":["6c4d010edfaaea6b"]}